  "sandbox_stdout": "Parent: n=256, C5=0.3808989437\n\n--- Phase 1: DE exploration at n=256 ---\n  DE seed=42: C5=0.4168362496\n  DE seed=142: C5=0.4069434353\n  DE seed=242: C5=0.4134311972\n\n--- Phase 2: SLSQP multi-beta ---\n\n--- Phase 3: Subgradient ---\n  C5=0.3808989437\n\n--- Phase 4: Simulated annealing ---\n  C5=0.3808989437\n\n--- Phase 5: Focused DE ---\n  Focused DE failed: 'DifferentialEvolutionSolver' object has no attrib\n  Focused DE failed: 'DifferentialEvolutionSolver' object has no attrib\n\n--- Phase 6: SLSQP round 2 ---\n\n--- Phase 7: Higher resolution ---\n  Upsampled n=384: C5=0.3814478828\n  n=384: C5=0.3809012221 (no improvement)\n  Upsampled n=512: C5=0.3813816713\n  n=512: C5=0.3809011596 (no improvement)\n\n--- Phase 8: Coordinate descent ---\n  C5=0.3808989437\n\n--- Phase 9: Final high-beta polish ---\n\nFINAL: n=256, C5=0.3808988913",
